## L. Conv. forzada <a name="l"></a>

### Def. Núm
Nusselt:
$$Nu = \frac{h \cdot x}{k}$$
Reynolds:
$$Re = \frac{\rho\cdot v\cdot x}{\mu}$$
Prandtl:
$$Pr = \frac{\mu \cdot c_p}{k}$$
Grashof:
$$Gr = \frac{g \beta \Delta T x^3}{\nu^2}$$

### Placa plana
Laminar
(Re < 5e5):
$$Nu_x = 0.332 \cdot Re_x^{1/2} \cdot Pr^{1/3}$$
$$Nu_L = 0.664 \cdot Re_L^{1/2} \cdot Pr^{1/3}$$
Turbulento
(Re > 5e5):
$$Nu_x = 0.0296 \cdot Re_x^{4/5} \cdot Pr^{1/3}$$
$$Nu_L = (0.037 \cdot Re_L^{4/5} - 871) \cdot Pr^{1/3}$$

### Tuberías
Laminar
(Re < 2300):
Muy larga
(Ts = cte)
$$Nu_D = 3.66$$
Calor cte
$$Nu_D = 4.36$$
Turbulento
(Dittus B.):
$$Nu_D = 0.023 \cdot Re_D^{4/5} \cdot Pr^n$$
